    ["<Assistant_Title1>【社交·炫富】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>每周玩法奖励动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得社交·炫富，可点击<Assistant_System>动作表情</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-报销商店</>使用发票单据兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social·Showing Off Wealth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Weekly Gameplay Reward Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Social·Showing Off Wealth. You can click <Assistant_System>Action Emotes</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop-General Merchandise-Reimbursement Shop</> using invoice receipts to redeem",
